    <span class="tag tag-purple">Gemma 4</span>
    <span class="tag tag-cyan">Multimodal</span>
    <span class="tag tag-green">Interactive</span>
  </div>
  <h1>Gemma 4 12B Explained:<br/>The Encoder-Free Multimodal Revolution</h1>
  <p class="lead">Google DeepMind's Gemma 4 12B drops separate vision and audio encoders entirely, feeding raw image patches and acoustic frames directly into a single transformer decoder. We unpack the math of its 35M vision embedder, its 40ms audio slicer, and its shared-KV speculative MTP assistant.</p>
  <div class="post-hero-meta">
    <span>June 4, 2026</span>
    <span>{readTime}</span>
    <span>Ecosystem: Apache 2.0 Open Weights</span>
  </div>
